    </section>

    <section class="corner" id="c-about">
      <span class="corner-h">about</span>
      <p class="about-body">I care about AI being good for the people it touches. Two questions hold most of my attention:</p>
      <p class="about-q"><span class="about-n">1</span> What's in the latent space, and can we learn to read it and reach in?</p>
      <p class="about-q"><span class="about-n">2</span> What happens where a human and an AI meet, and how do we design that interface?</p>
      <p class="about-coda">Both questions point to something far more complex, subtle, and fertile than first appears, rewarding a kind of close attention I'm drawn towards.</p>
    </section>

