        <div class="patch idea umber"><div class="patch-title">A reader that shows the latent space of what you're reading</div></div>
        <div class="patch idea umber"><div class="patch-title">Therapy-sim for hard conversations you're about to have</div></div>
        <div class="patch idea umber"><div class="patch-title">An interface to "reach into" a model's reasoning and nudge it</div></div>
        <div class="patch idea umber"><div class="patch-title">A personal site that's a place, not a poster</div></div>
        <div class="patch idea umber"><div class="patch-title">Margin notes that argue back</div></div>
