      <div class="grid">
        <div class="patch sage"><div class="patch-title">Reading</div><div class="patch-line">Joe Carlsmith's "Otherness and Control in the Age of AGI."</div></div>
        <div class="patch umber"><div class="patch-title">Building</div><div class="patch-line">Rethinking this very site — from a single-screen poster into a place with corners.</div></div>
